# `58:2::255:0:0` sets an underline colour. Flattened to semicolons it becomes
# `58;2;;255;0;0`, where the empty parameter reads as SGR 0 and wipes everything.
size: 12x2
description: an underline colour does not reset the pending attributes

--- input
\e[1m\e[58:2::255:0:0mA

--- expect-cell
row=0 col=0 bold=true
